{"v":4,"catch":"故事的主角，是一名被稱作「世界」的少女——","desc":"這是一個將一切奉獻給世界的少女與一名青年之間的純愛故事。\n三則以隨機順序展開的故事，最終將匯聚為一。\n本作品活用視覺小説這一載體的特性，旨在令玩家沉浸式體驗那段近乎瘋狂的純愛故事。愿您讀完最後一句文本時，仍能在心底留下難以言説的餘韻。","publisher":"Laplacian","release":"2026-03-19","genres":["冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 6.5GB / Switch 6.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7250e3037b15995b7703bb27f7e359cea2b8c219e5f8036fe15e71959a326920.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/00fe2f97c29277c89facf0fc474cedff8ed72e0768f8a4efdcc38577b322393e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/854722906589a1ea71efb5a1e8ce110d9e374449ced105134daea507be514eef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/806913a547d8ee20e37a2542444d22e9527a8c26ee215c4dda71bc43e7da8865.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/80759ccaa4408ebee2d4e443c53a34c5f95930e79186982ef522780191be631d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/81ff78a459611f9388cca1fa0840565b12f2894908948b90995f341a53eb8be6.jpg"],"titleId":"01003b0018bc8000","dlc":[]}